, "x1": 0.8021978021978022, "y1": 0.30924630924630925}, {"text": "What is the probability that the ball that is still hidden is also red?", "x0": 0.24505494505494504, "y0": 0.3123543123543124, "x1": 0.7395604395604396, "y1": 0.3247863247863248}, {"text": "(b) v 1", "x0": 0.14395604395604394, "y0": 0.3434343434343434, "x1": 0.8703296703296703, "y1": 0.35742035742035744}, {"text": "oot t", "x0": 0.36153846153846153, "y0": 0.3791763791763792, "x1": 0.6967032967032967, "y1": 0.40326340326340326}, {"text": "A pen moves along the x axis, ruling a line. The diagram shows the graph of", "x0": 0.189010989010989, "y0": 0.5897435897435898, "x1": 0.8043956043956044, "y1": 0.6021756021756022}, {"text": "the velocity of the tip of the pen as a function of time.", "x0": 0.189010989010989, "y0": 0.6052836052836053, "x1": 0.5934065934065934, "y1": 0.6177156177156177}, {"text": "The velocity, in centimetres per second, is given by the equation", "x0": 0.1879120879120879, "y0": 0.6386946386946387, "x1": 0.6747252747252748, "y1": 0.6511266511266511}, {"text": "v=4r +201,", "x0": 0.4175824175824176, "y0": 0.6713286713286714, "x1": 0.5747252747252747, "y1": 0.6860916860916861}, {"text": "where f is the time in seconds. When the tip of the pen is at x=3. That", "x0": 0.189010989010989, "y0": 0.7094017094017094, "x1": 0.8032967032967033, "y1": 0.7218337218337219}, {"text": "is, the tip is initially 3 centimetres to the right of the origin.", "x0": 0.189010989010989, "y0": 0.7249417249417249, "x1": 0.6318681318681318, "y1": 0.7373737373737373}, {"text": "Find an expression for x, the position of the tip of the pen, as a function", "x0": 0.24505494505494504, "y0": 0.7583527583527584, "x1": 0.8021978021978022, "y1": 0.7707847707847708}, {"text": "of time.", "x0": 0.24505494505494504, "y0": 0.7738927738927739, "x1": 0.3021978021978022, "y1": 0.7832167832167832}, {"text": "(ii) What feature will the graph of x as a function of t have at", "x0": 0.2032967032967033, "y0": 0.8073038073038074, "x1"